IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COLDUP.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "COLQ".
01 WS-I PIC 9(05).

LINKAGE SECTION.
COPY "COLOP".
01 LS-DUP PIC X(01).

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BK-COL-PARMS LS-DUP.
    MOVE "N" TO LS-DUP
    MOVE "LIST" TO OL-OP
    CALL "COLQ" USING BK-COL-LIST
    IF OL-RC NOT = "00"
        MOVE "36" TO CO-RC
        MOVE "CASE LIST UNAVAILABLE" TO CO-MSG
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > OL-COUNT
        IF OL-LOAN(WS-I) = CO-LOAN-ID
            IF OL-STATUS(WS-I) NOT = "CLOS"
                AND OL-STATUS(WS-I) NOT = "FAIL"
                AND OL-STATUS(WS-I) NOT = "CANC"
                MOVE "Y" TO LS-DUP
            END-IF
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    GOBACK.
